Not linked into ~/.claude/skills/ by default, and /sync-config leaves it alone.

Nobody types this skill day to day, so carrying its trigger phrases in the always-loaded skill
list costs prompt surface in every session of every project. When it is wanted, link it by hand
and remove the link afterwards:

  ln -s <main-clone>/skills/vjudge ~/.claude/skills/vjudge
  rm ~/.claude/skills/vjudge

Any skill directory carrying this marker is treated the same way.
